.TH AERO-POWER-OPTIMIZER 1 "November 2026" "Aero Linux v1.4.0" "Aero Linux Manual"
.SH NAME
aero-power-optimizer \- Dynamic power management and battery threshold controller
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aero-power-optimizer
[B\-\-thresholdR IPercentR] [B\-\-statusR] [B\-\-helpR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B aero-power-optimizer
configures battery health charge thresholds and adjusts CPU energy performance policies.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-threshold " " IPercentR
Set charging stop threshold percentage (default: 80).
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-status
Display current charge threshold and governor state.
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Display usage synopsis.
